{{Velious Era}}
'''Cobalt Scar''' is named after the scarring left by Veeshan as she clawed Norrath during the Dawn of Days is more evident in here than just about any other area in Norrath. Large amounts of water has filled in the gouges she left behind, and now the sirens of the [[Siren's Grotto]] use its cover to lure unknowing ship crews into protruding rocks. On the land, Drakes & Wyverns of [[Skyshrine]] fiercely protect their habitat while a clan of Othmir critters make their home on the beach below the cliffside.

