== Dangers ==

*Drakes & Wyverns can be found all along the top of the ridge. These are on [[Claws of Veeshan]] faction, so if you can safely travel through [[Skyshrine]] you can travel through here. The exit back to [[Skyshrine]] is also surrounded by Wyverns, and if they don't like you invis will be needed.

*Othmir will attack anyone in wolf form.

*Sirens can be found throughout the large body of water. All of them are ENC and many are difficult to spot. Since they are enchanters, they are especially dangerous, with charm and magic-based direct damage spells.

*Bulthar can be found underneath the tower leading to [[Skyshrine]]. They have a very large aggro radius, but do not see invis.

*Kelorek'Dar is occasionally found in the water swimming about. He is dangerous for obvious reasons, and water travel is not very safe, instead you should levi over it all.

== Benefits ==

*Othmirs generally like anyone and provide merchants/quests. They used to act as guards when fighting the cobalt drakes, but they '''no longer''' do so.

*While the Drakes & Wyverns are on [[Claws of Veeshan]] faction, killing them does not decrease your faction at all. The named ones, however, '''will''' give you faction hits.

*Being that this zone is quite open, it is a good place to fight solo (popular quading spot).

*Gems needed for [[Velious Class Armor]] drop frequently here.

== Traveling To and From ==

To enter '''Cobalt Scar''' you must first travel through [[Skyshrine]]. A [[Key to Cobalt Scar]] is required to use the teleporter inside the dragon city to zone here. Someone who already has a key can also group with you and click you through. Once you obtain the CS tooth from the portal, however, you can also teleport here. A WIZ can TL you directly to CS without the need of a tooth or key.

*[[Skyshrine]] is located atop the tower were you can click the statue surrounded by wyverns. This requires nothing.

*[[Siren's Grotto]] is located underwater in the Northwest. Following along the cliff face, you can see the cave opening.

*[[Plane of Mischief]] zone out in the water around (76, 560).

